---
/**
 * SplitHero.astro
 * Inspired by 21st.dev "serafim/splite" — a split-layout hero with
 * gradient beam accents and a premium kernel showcase panel.
 *
 * Content Preservation Rule:
 *   This component preserves EXACTLY the same hero text, CTAs, links,
 *   and semantic structure as the original SparklesHero. Only the
 *   visual/technical implementation changed.
 *
 * Performance:
 *   - 0KB JavaScript (no Sparkles/TSParticles canvas)
 *   - Pure CSS gradient beams (GPU-accelerated)
 *   - Respects prefers-reduced-motion
 *   - LCP-optimized: hero text is server-rendered, no hydration needed
 */

// No client-side framework imports — this is 100% static SSR.
---

<section class="split-hero" aria-label="BrightAI الرئيسية">
